{"type":"text","timestamp":1778975632188,"sessionID":"ses_1cccb23aeffeggp6wQdr0yt1hz","part":{"id":"prt_e3335e0f1001YsZ6fANjByEe2t","messageID":"msg_e3335cbef001vROu4CpNFHOfiG","sessionID":"ses_1cccb23aeffeggp6wQdr0yt1hz","type":"text","text":"I found `skeletogenic cell` (`CL_0007001`) as the closest existing parent matching the requested “skeletal cell”, and `UBERON_0001434` is already used in CL for periosteum. I’ll add a new NTR-scoped `CL_99xxxxx` term with mouse taxon restriction, periosteum location, issue tracker annotation, contributor, creator, and date.","time":{"start":1778975629553,"end":1778975632185}}}
